Acknowledgements & Third-Party MIT Notices

Portions of the colour palette, status bar colours, collapsible bag bar logic,
and minimap/window compatibility patterns are adapted from FlareUI's source
code (Copyright (c) 2026 Malkkav), used under the MIT License above.

The media files in Media/ are KaLi HUD's own. Most are drawn by its tools
(hud/tools/make_media.py). The window cartouches (Cartouche*) and the minimap
rings (MinimapRing*) are cut from images Ikar generated with Google Gemini
(hud/tools/cut_art.py and make_cartouches.py, cut_rings.py and make_rings.py);
those images themselves are not published. The materials of the plate's
background are the game's own and are not shipped.
